# Swap execution (path-scoped)

- `executionMode`: `canonical` | `eoa` — user parent CSW is sender for canonical; external EOA for eoa track.
- **No idle re-quote loops** on `/swap` — quote on input change; rebuild stale quotes at review/submit only.
- **Paymaster:** batched wrap+approve+swap; CDP denies approve-only UserOps.
- **canonical4337** required in production for sponsored CSW swaps — no silent fallback to direct gas sends when sponsorship denied.
- `PROTOCOL_CSW_ADDRESS` is protocol agent only — user swap sender is `profiles.csw_address`.

Incident detail: `docs/agent-context/archives/swap-execution.md`. Template: `.cursor/commands/swap-bug.md`.

Validate: `pnpm -C frontend validate:swap`
